WEBVTT

00:05:59.542 --> 00:06:03.268
so that it will become power to,
rather than power over.

00:06:03.292 --> 00:06:04.768
But everybody understands

00:06:04.792 --> 00:06:08.476
that power isn't just the vertical axis
that comes with authority,

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:11.143
anybody who's ever had
a two-year-old knows that.

00:06:11.167 --> 00:06:15.059
I mean, this idea that power is just
a matter of authority and hierarchy,

00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:16.351
that's one.

00:06:16.375 --> 00:06:19.226
But you can have power
that comes from the bottom up.

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:21.143
You can have power that is the power

00:06:21.167 --> 00:06:23.434
that constantly
kind of deflects the energy,

00:06:23.458 --> 00:06:27.934
the power that takes the authority
away from the people in authority,

00:06:27.958 --> 00:06:29.226
that is also power.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:33.559
It is actually multifaceted
and intrinsic to relationship.